  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start by making the curry sauce by heating a saucepan over medium heat. Add the diced onion and heat until fragrant.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the red curry paste and canned tomatoes. Stir to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the heavy whipping cream, chicken stock, and salt to taste. Stir to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pulse in a blender until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash shrimp and pat dry.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spiralize the zucchinis in a veggie spiralizer. Then, cook the zucchini noodles in a skillet until tender.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a skillet over medium heat, add in the olive oil with the shrimp. Cook the shrimp for 2-4 minutes. Remove the shrimp from heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the curry sauce into the pan and bring it to a simmer for 2-3 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the shrimp back into the skillet and cook for another 2-3 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Curried-Shrimp-Zucchini-Skillet-Meal-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the shrimp curry over the top of the zucchini noodles. Top with chopped cilantro and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-curry-zucchini-skillet/#wprm-recipe-54067-step-0-10",
